  "label": "Goat as Analogical Stand-in for Stoner Friend",
  "description": "The use of a goat staring judgmentally is a visual metaphor to represent the perceived 'weird' or 'mischievous' demeanor of a stoner friend. This relies on the cultural association of goats with unpredictability or mischief, which is not directly visible but understood from real-world knowledge.",
